{"id":"n49252-3-8","stage":3,"title":"소재 · 题材","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49252-3-8-1","ko":"작가께서는 요즘 어떤 작품을 쓰고 계십니까?","zh":"请问作家最近在创作什么作品呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"작가께서는","meaning":"作家","explanation":"작가：作家；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"작가","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58277","senseId":"1","lemma":"작가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작품을","meaning":"作品","explanation":"작품：作品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"작품","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24837","senseId":"2","lemma":"작품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰고","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계십니까?","meaning":"(尊称)在。表示继续做前面所述的事情或指其结果正在持续。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)在。表示继续做前面所述的事情或指其结果正在持续。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61346","senseId":"1","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"07dda968bf6b7241","term":"작가","zh":"作家","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3","entryId":"58277","definition":"原创出诗歌、小说、剧本、画等的人。","pronunciation":["작까"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"eec1d8d2d561e94f","term":"작품","zh":"作品","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3","entryId":"24837","definition":"画、雕刻、小说、诗等通过艺术创作活动制成的东西。","pronunciation":["작품"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写，创作","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"将头脑中的想法或感觉等用文字记在纸上而使其现出来。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"(尊称)在。表示继续做前面所述的事情或指其结果正在持续。","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"61346","definition":"(尊称)在。表示继续做前面所述的事情或指其结果正在持续。","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cc400bd4421dfb567ca3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49252-3-8-2","ko":"사랑 이야기를 소재로 하여 소설을 쓰고 있습니다.","zh":"我正在以爱情故事为题材写小说。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사랑","meaning":"爱，爱情，恋情","explanation":"사랑：爱，爱情，恋情","readings":[{"term":"사랑","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66649","senseId":"1","lemma":"사랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이야기를","meaning":"故事","explanation":"이야기：故事；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"1","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소재로","meaning":"题材","explanation":"소재：题材；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"소재","audio":"/audio/a795d57b8b9f311a7169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49252","senseId":"3","lemma":"소재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하여","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소설을","meaning":"小说","explanation":"소설：小说；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소설","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32185","senseId":"1","lemma":"소설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰고","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ff2763f11c21f167","term":"사랑","zh":"爱，爱情，恋情","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3","entryId":"66649","definition":"从对方身上感到性魅力而热烈喜欢的心。","pronunciation":["사랑"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"故事","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"说或写给别人的关于某个事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等的话或文章。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"a795d57b8b9f311a","term":"소재","zh":"题材","audio":"/audio/a795d57b8b9f311a7169.mp3","entryId":"49252","definition":"构成文章内容的材料。","pronunciation":["소재"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"88c77f43092f9156","term":"소설","zh":"小说","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3","entryId":"32185","definition":"作家虚构出来的、以故事形式写成的文学作品。","pronunciation":["소ː설"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写，创作","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"将头脑中的想法或感觉等用文字记在纸上而使其现出来。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5079fcd1ee40454c6501.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.985,"source":{"url"